WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.890
Ethics Commissioner.

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.829
Violations found.

00:00:03.829 --> 00:00:05.965
Zero consequences.

00:00:05.965 --> 00:00:11.522
The Ethics Commissioner exists to investigate conflicts of interest among public office holders.

00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:15.954
The Commissioner can investigate, find violations, and publish reports.

00:00:15.954 --> 00:00:23.499
The Commissioner cannot prosecute, cannot impose penalties beyond public disclosure, and cannot compel compliance with recommendations.

00:00:23.499 --> 00:00:29.738
The result: violations are documented, reports are published, and the violators continue in office.

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:31.193
The record.

00:00:31.193 --> 00:00:35.772
Every major Ethics Commissioner finding mapped against its actual consequence.

00:00:35.772 --> 00:00:39.897
PM Trudeau: Section 9 violated in SNC-Lavalin.

00:00:39.897 --> 00:00:42.238
Consequence: re-elected.

00:00:42.238 --> 00:00:46.306
Christiane Fox: Section 9 breached at IRCC.

00:00:46.306 --> 00:00:49.954
Consequence: promoted to DND by PM Carney.

00:00:49.954 --> 00:00:55.352
The pattern: find the violation, publish the report, impose no consequence, repeat.

00:00:55.352 --> 00:00:57.534
The structural limitation.

00:00:57.534 --> 00:01:00.272
The Ethics Commissioner can investigate.

00:01:00.272 --> 00:01:03.011
The Commissioner can find violations.

00:01:03.011 --> 00:01:05.624
The Commissioner can publish reports.

00:01:05.624 --> 00:01:08.090
The Commissioner cannot prosecute.

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:10.227
Cannot impose fines.

00:01:10.227 --> 00:01:12.897
Cannot remove anyone from office.

00:01:12.897 --> 00:01:15.102
Cannot compel compliance.

00:01:15.102 --> 00:01:19.943
The entire accountability mechanism produces documentation without enforcement.

00:01:19.943 --> 00:01:27.988
This is the same pattern as the MPCC in military justice, the Procurement Ombudsman in fraud, and NSIRA in intelligence oversight.

00:01:27.988 --> 00:01:31.920
Every oversight body in Canada can investigate and report.

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.874
None can enforce.

00:01:33.874 --> 00:01:37.590
Accountability without enforcement is institutional theatre.
